<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $1.25-$1.75 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $1.25-$1.75 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.25-1.75 higher. Trading moderately active. Top $61.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    60.00-61.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    59.50-60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    58.50-59.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>	    300-320 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 1.50-1.75 higher; 450-650 lbs 1.00-1.50 higher.</p>
<p>Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    48.00-48.25, mostly 48.00</p>
<p>	    450-650 lbs    49.00</p>
</text>
